WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.721
Here come the blobs.

2
00:00:05.722 --> 00:00:08.507
What do they see?

3
00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:13.956
They see a kitchen.

4
00:00:13.957 --> 00:00:48.138
The blobs go inside.

5
00:00:48.139 --> 00:00:59.271
They get some tomatoes and onions.

6
00:00:59.272 --> 00:01:13.789
They get some garlic.

7
00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:26.148
They get some meat.

8
00:01:26.149 --> 00:01:52.682
They get some pasta.

9
00:01:52.683 --> 00:02:05.396
They get some cheese.

10
00:02:05.397 --> 00:02:10.080
The blobs are ready to cook.

11
00:02:10.081 --> 00:02:17.001
Blobs, don't make a mess!

12
00:02:17.002 --> 00:02:20.845
Wow! The blobs are great chefs.

13
00:02:20.846 --> 00:02:43.764
They made spaghetti and meatballs.

14
00:02:43.765 --> 00:02:46.742
Silly blobs.

15
00:02:46.743 --> 00:02:49.906
Good-bye!

